    <div class="card p-5"><h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-700 mb-3"><i class="fas fa-chart-line mr-2 text-orange-500"></i>연체율 추이</h3><div class="chart-wrap-lg"><canvas id="tr-od"></canvas></div></div>
